  triage:description "plan.md still reads 'Status: **proposed**'. Its header covers review rounds 1-4 and 6 only, and does not mention round 5. The Phase acceptance section says it runs 'after r-1, r-4, r-2, r-3, r-3c, r-2b, r-3b merge', which omits r-7, r-5 and r-6. The next paragraph adds their blocks only 'after r-7 and r-6 merge'. docs/requirements.md:148 is headed 'Phase A.1 — refinement (proposed)', and its preamble says rows carry '(Proposed, r-N)' markers, but none remain. The anchor #phase-a1--refinement-proposed is linked from docs/sc-agent-types/requirements.md:28. Set the plan status to complete, or to the state the phase-end gate defines. Update the Phase acceptance preamble to list all ten sprints. Retitle the docs/requirements.md heading, reword its preamble, and update the anchor link in docs/sc-agent-types/requirements.md:28. partially-compliant" ;
